///////////////////////////////add////////////////////////////////////////////////
To add new move:
Create:
  features/roundhouse_features.py
  rules/roundhouse_rules.py
  engine/roundhouse_state_machine.py
  techniques/roundhouse_kick.py

Add to registry:
  "roundhouse_kick": RoundhouseTechnique

No change in main.py.